\par 
\par OpCode (001): The instruction (The Work Order).
\par 
\par Decoding: The CU realizes 001 = Addition.
\par 
\par Control Signal: The CU sends a voltage pulse down the wire.
\par 
\par Activation: That pulse hits the ALU and physically opens the "Addition Path."
